<v Host>A simple test showed all ten birds were positive.

00:03:43.328 --> 00:03:45.632
<v Vocab>陽性

00:03:46.032 --> 00:03:49.032
<v Host>It means positive, as in a test result.

00:03:49.632 --> 00:03:58.439
<v Slow>そして12日、詳しい検査で、鳥インフルエンザだとわかりました。

00:03:59.240 --> 00:04:03.536
