<v Vocab>殺処分

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:29.072
<v Host>It means culling, killing animals to stop a disease.

00:04:29.672 --> 00:04:37.471
<v Slow>消毒などの作業が終わるまで、1週間ぐらいかかる見込みです。

00:04:38.271 --> 00:04:41.848
<v Host>Disinfection and other work should take about a week.

